    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17670" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτο-δίδακτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ],
